    "collapsible-row-list-1": {
      "type": "collapsible-row-list",
      "blocks": {
        "block-0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How long will my order take to be delivered",
            "text": "<p>Our delivery times nationwide are 3-5 days after your order has been confirmed. Orders within Islamabad can arrive within 1-2 days after your order has been confirmed. The delivery time of all orders is subject to change depending on weather and public safety conditions.</p>"
          }
        },
        "fecaeb76-9d3e-4673-a8af-2003493c0772": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What do I do if my order was delayed or lost during delivery?",
            "text": "<p>We are really sorry for this delay and that your package has not been delivered to you on time. </p><p>Please reach out to us at <a href=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\">support@northnaturals.com</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "618b48de-f4d3-41a1-910a-92ac4c344b03": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Can I change or cancel my order after it has been placed?",
            "text": "<p>Yes, you can change or cancel your order in 3 hours after the order completion. Please write to us at <a href=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\">support@northnaturals.com</a> or call/WhatsApp at <strong>+92</strong> 327 8859969</p>"
          }
        },
        "block-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Unable to place order what to do?",
            "text": "<p>If you experience any difficulty placing an order, please contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\">support@northnaturals.com</a>  or call or WhatsApp us at +92 <strong>327 8859969. </strong>Our lines are open Monday through Saturday from 10 am to 6:00 pm. <strong>Please note</strong> that if you e-mail or WhatsApp us outside working hours, we endeavor to get back to you within 24 hours.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block-3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What do I do if the product arrives damaged?",
            "text": "<p>If you have received a damaged, or defected product, you can write to us at <a href=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\">support@northnaturals.com</a> and our customer service representative will facilitate you in the best way possible. Please make sure to contact our team within 48 hours after receiving your order. Complaints made after 48 hours will not be facilitated.</p>"
          }
        },
        "b0ac10a6-59a1-4c07-8834-97c52042c132": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What is your payment method?",
            "text": "<p>You can pay online through any bank. Our online payment method is secured. We also offer cash on delivery.</p>"
          }
        },
        "ae80352f-ebac-4bb9-9396-043cbd737375": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How secure is your online payment method?",
            "text": "<p>North Naturals follow strict customer data security policy through end-to-end data encryption.</p>"
          }
        },
        "6704d7ec-4963-4036-abdf-c24d0a68d804": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How can I contact North Naturals customer care representative?",
            "text": "<p>You can write to us at <a href=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\">support@northnaturals.com</a> or call/ Whatsapp us at <strong>+92</strong> 327 8859969 and our customer service representative will facilitate you in the best way possible.</p>"
          }
        },
        "77bd5764-58c1-4ec4-b026-cc56f35a9dc5": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Are the product prices inclusive of tax?",
            "text": "<p>Yes our product prices are inclusive of tax</p>"
          }
        },
        "a0f2706e-5e69-4c76-9240-0b8332287af8": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do you share customs information on Internet?",
            "text": "<p>We do not share or sell any information you submit to the North Naturals.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
