    "collapsible-row-list-2": {
      "type": "collapsible-row-list",
      "blocks": {
        "block-2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do you ship globally?",
            "text": "<p>We do ship globally. You can place your order at www.northnaturals.com and contact us at <a href=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\">support@northnaturals.com</a> for further information about shipping rates.</p>"
          }
        },
        "6375f0fe-894a-4915-b80f-87318f2b0b43": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How do I change the address/details of my order?",
            "text": "<p>Once an order is placed, we cannot make any changes as we have a very quick turnaround time to get your order to you as fast as possible. So please ensure that you double check your details when entering them at checkout. </p><p>or else inform us on call/ WhatsApp <strong>+92</strong> 327 8859969 ASAP</p>"
          }
        },
        "block-0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How do I return a product?",
            "text": "<p>Our customers are the center of our business, and we strive to ensure purity of our products. For details on our refunds & exchanges policy, please visit <a href=\"/pages/returns\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Returns\"><strong>here</strong></a></p>"
          }
        },
        "block-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How much is shipping?",
            "text": "<p>We offer free delivery all across Pakistan.</p>"
          }
        },
        "block-3": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "Do you offer exchange?",
            "text": "<p>Our customers are the center of our business, and we strive to ensure purity of our products. For details on exchanges policy, please visit <a href=\"/pages/returns\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Returns\"><strong>here</strong></a></p>"
          }
        },
        "eb31ba8e-2319-4344-91e1-162b0bb2285f": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "How do I track my order?",
            "text": "<p>Once you place an order with us, you will receive tracking email updates as soon as your parcel is dispatched from our end, and a tracking number to easily follow the journey of your package.</p><p>If you have any questions or concerns about your order, don’t hesitate to reach out at <a href=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:support@northnaturals.com\">support@northnaturals.com</a></p>"
          }
        },
        "bb35313f-89b6-4a59-84b0-36f52c144ac9": {
          "type": "item",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "expand_by_default": false,
            "icon": "none",
            "title": "What shipping carriers do you use?",
            "text": "<p>This is an example of a response that you might give. It's good to be as thorough as possible in responses as that has a tendency to improve trust overall.</p>"
